          ],
          "coverage": "pending"
        },
        {
          "id": "extremal-consequences",
          "description": "Supremum over all graphs on Fin n obeys the same upper bound. The explicit finite witness gives H(15) >= 8/7 and a necessary lower bound on any uniform C, not an optimal C or exact H(15).",
